(text "R1-R6: 10k, 1%, >=0.1 W; target 0603. At L298 inputs; actual module bias / reset state still need E05.\nST L298 Table 4 sizing: 10 uA x 10.1k = 0.101 V; added GPIO load at 3.3 V <= 0.433 mA (table conditions).\nPhoto control columns L to R: ENA, IN1, IN2, IN3, IN4, ENB; jumper contact identities need continuity check.\nEN LOW = free-running stop, not active braking. Pull-downs cannot stop a GPIO stuck HIGH. Keep SW2 independent.\nNew-supply current, thermal and reverse-energy tests pending; see parameter-confirmation.md for limits." (at 20.32 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid 32ec9460-a336-57d9-8ffb-37f7d28bae05))
)
